  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "hie for his lare \u00e6t \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Enilius Paulus se consul for on African mid \u00ferim hunde scipa to Clepeam \u00fe\u00e6m & him comon \u00fe\u00e6r ongean Punice mid swa fela scipa, & \u00fe\u00e6r gefliemde w\u00e6ron, & hiora folces w\u00e6s & Romana w\u00e6s an C & an M ofslagen, & heora scipa IX adruncen. & hie on \u00fe\u00e6m iglande f\u00e6sten worhton. & hie \u00f0\u00e6r eft Pene gesohton mid heora twam cyningum, \u00fea w\u00e6ron begen Hannan hatene. \u00de\u00e6r heora w\u00e6ron IX M ofslagen, & \u00fea o\u00fere gefliemed. Mid \u00fe\u00e6re herehy\u00fee Romane oferhl\u00e6stan heora scipa, \u00fea hi hamweard w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t heora gedearf \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Amilcor Pena cyning for on Numedian, & on Mauritaniam, & hie oferhergeade, & to \u00de\u00e6s ymb III gear Serfilius Cepio & Sempronius Blesus \u00fea consulas foran mid III hund scipa & & si\u00fe\u00fean mid miclum \u00feingum hamweard foran, & eft hiora scipa oferhl\u00e6ston, \u00fe\u00e6t hiora gedurfon L \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Cotta se consul for on Sicilie, & hie ealle oferhergeade. \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6ron swa micle monslihtas on \u00e6g\u00feere healfe \u00fe\u00e6t hie mon \u00e6t nihstan bebyrgan ne mehte. On Luciuses d\u00e6ge Eliuses, \u00fe\u00e6s consules, & on Metelluses Gaiuses, & on Foriuses Blaciduses, Ac si\u00fe\u00fean Metellus \u00fea elpendas ofercom, si\u00fe\u00fean he h\u00e6fde eac ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00feer folc gefliemed. \u00c6fter",
